/// Ghost Train block — Upper/Lower A/B split. See rules/strength-authoring.md for the spec
/// this implements and strength/notes.md for the full design writeup, including why this
/// file explicitly restates every exercise every week instead of relying on Liftoscript's
/// documented carry-forward (empty `## Day`) mechanism.
///
/// TESTED AND REJECTED: leaving unchanged exercises out of later weeks so they "carry
/// forward." Verified via run_playground with real chained execution (Week 1 completed for
/// real via complete_set()+finish_workout(), then Week 2 simulated from the resulting
/// updatedProgramText) — Week 2 still returned "Exercise not found." Reproduced across six
/// separate test constructions, including one built directly from the tool's own
/// documented example. Root cause unconfirmed (simulator limitation vs. real engine
/// behavior), but the risk of a live 0lb/missing-exercise session isn't worth it.
///
/// So: every week below is fully self-contained, and was spot-verified via run_playground
/// with real complete_set() commands against weeks 1, 5, 8, and 10 — all resolved the
/// exact declared weight/scheme. Main-lift weights are a HAND-AUTHORED, deliberately
/// conservative progression (not measured maxes — see athlete/zones.yml and the
/// "My Program 2" equipment-mismatch note in strength/notes.md), stepping up ~5lb/week
/// (2.5lb on OHP/Pull Up) and holding or dropping on the weeks training/block.md calls out
/// as reduced (BIG DAY week 5, Lower A taper week 8, Lower B/Upper B taper week 10). This
/// file should be re-pushed periodically as real numbers come in from actual sessions —
/// consistent with how this repo already re-authors weeks from log/ feedback.

# Week 1

## Lower A — primary strength
main: Squat / ! 3x5 / 2x5 / 1x5 / 95lb / 180s
main: Romanian Deadlift / ! 3x6 / 2x6 / 1x6 / 95lb / 150s
accessory: Bulgarian Split Squat / 3x8 / 30lb / 90s
core: Hanging Leg Raise / 3x10 / 0lb / 60s

## Upper A
main: Bench Press / ! 3x5 / 2x5 / 1x5 / 65lb / 180s
main: Bent Over Row / 3x8 / 65lb / 120s
accessory: Overhead Press / 3x8 / 45lb / 90s
core: Pallof Press / 3x10 / 20lb / 60s

## Lower B — runner-specific, low fatigue
/// Single Leg Calf Raise is the highest-value accessory in the whole program for
/// ultra durability — protect this one when trimming volume, cut something else first.
accessory: Single Leg Calf Raise / 4x12 / 0lb / 60s
accessory: Nordic Curl / 3x6 / 0lb / 90s
accessory: Single Leg Deadlift / 3x10 / 25lb / 60s
accessory: Copenhagen Plank / 3x1 30s|30s
core: Dead Bug / 3x12 / 0lb / 45s

## Upper B
/// Champion Plan's Sunday flex day; paired with the easy/mod run.
main: Pull Up / ! 3x6 / 2x6 / 1x6 / 10lb / 150s / update: custom() {~
  if (setIndex == 0) {
    weights = bodyweight + originalWeights[ns]
  }
~}
main: Incline Bench Press / 3x8 / 55lb / 120s
accessory: Face Pull / 3x15 / 30lb / 60s
core: Side Plank / 3x1 30s|30s

